%% Workflows A/B: consultation to pharmacy dispensing
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor D as Doctor
  participant FE as Next.js (doctor UI)
  participant API as Spring Boot API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  actor P as Pharmacist
  participant FP as Next.js (pharmacist UI)

  %% ---- body ----
  D->>FE: Enter patient number
  FE->>API: GET /patients/by-number/{n}
  API->>DB: SELECT patient WHERE patient_number = upper(n)
  alt patient exists
    API-->>FE: 200 PatientResponse (+ audit PATIENT_VIEWED)
    FE->>API: GET /patients/{id}/medical-history?page=0
    API->>DB: page of consultations + batch loads (no N+1)
    API-->>FE: 200 MedicalHistoryResponse
  else not found (Workflow B)
    API-->>FE: 404 PATIENT_NOT_FOUND
    D->>FE: Fill registration form
    FE->>API: POST /patients (Idempotency-Key K1)
    API->>DB: BEGIN, INSERT idempotency_keys, INSERT patients, INSERT audit, COMMIT
    API-->>FE: 201 PatientResponse (409 DUPLICATE_PATIENT_NUMBER if taken)
  end
  %% ---- part 2 ----
  D->>FE: Diagnoses, notes, medicines (1..30 items)
  FE->>API: POST /consultations (Idempotency-Key K2)
  activate API
  API->>DB: BEGIN
  API->>DB: INSERT idempotency_keys (blocks if duplicate in flight)
  API->>DB: validate patient, medicines active, queue entry
  API->>DB: INSERT consultations, consultation_diagnoses
  API->>DB: INSERT prescriptions (status PENDING), prescription_items
  API->>DB: INSERT audit_events, COMMIT
  API-->>FE: 201 ConsultationResponse (RX number, PENDING)
  deactivate API
  Note over FE,API: Any error rolls back everything. Form data stays in memory, retry reuses K2.

  %% ---- part 3 ----
  loop every 10 s while tab visible
    FP->>API: GET /prescriptions?status=PENDING&status=IN_PROGRESS
    API-->>FP: 200 PrescriptionSummaryPage (oldest first)
  end
  P->>FP: Open RX
  FP->>API: GET /prescriptions/{id}
  API-->>FP: 200 items + minimal patient data + allergies
  P->>FP: Start preparing
  FP->>API: POST /prescriptions/{id}/start
  API->>DB: SELECT ... FOR UPDATE, PENDING -> IN_PROGRESS
  API-->>FP: 200 IN_PROGRESS
  P->>FP: Confirm quantities and "Mark as Dispensed"
  FP->>API: POST /prescriptions/{id}/dispense (Idempotency-Key K3)
  activate API
  API->>DB: BEGIN, INSERT idempotency_keys, SELECT prescription FOR UPDATE
  API->>DB: check status in (PENDING, IN_PROGRESS) and item rules
  API->>DB: INSERT dispensings (UNIQUE prescription_id), dispensing_items
  API->>DB: UPDATE prescriptions SET status = DISPENSED, INSERT audit, COMMIT
  API-->>FP: 200 DISPENSED (outcome FULL or PARTIAL)
  deactivate API
  Note over FP,API: Double click with K3 replays 200. Another pharmacist gets 409 INVALID_STATUS_TRANSITION.

  %% ---- part 4 ----
  loop every 10 s on consultation screen until terminal
    FE->>API: GET /consultations/{id}
    API-->>FE: 200 prescription status DISPENSED + dispensing details
  end
  FE-->>D: "Dispensed by Kamal Silva at 10:15 (partial)"
